erified:\n\n### **Core Components Deployed:**\n\n1. **Git Server** - Accessible via SSH at `git@localhost:/git/project.git`\n   - Password authentication enabled (username: `git`, password: `password`)\n   - Bare repository at `/git/project.git`\n\n2. **SSH Server** - OpenSSH configured with password authentication on port 22\n\n3. **Nginx HTTPS Server** - Serving on port 8443 with self-signed certificate\n   - Main branch: `https://localhost:8443/index.html`\n   - Dev branch: `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html`\n\n4. **Automated Deployment** - Post-receive hook triggers on every push\n   - Deployment time: ~400ms (well within 3-second requirement)\n   - Automatic branch checkout to deployment directories\n\n### **Deliverables in `/app`:**\n\n- **git-server-setup.sh** - Automated setup script (can re-run if needed)\n- **test-git-server.sh** - Comprehensive test suite (8 verification tests - all pass ✅)\n- **README.md** - Complete setup documentation\n- **USAGE.md** - Quick start guide with examples\n- **SYSTEM_INFO.md** - System reference and configuration details\n\n### **All Requirements Verified:**\n\n✅ Git server accessible over SSH at `git@localhost:/git/project.git`  \n✅ Password authentication (`git:password`)  \n✅ Main branch deploys to `https://localhost:8443/index.html`  \n✅ Dev branch deploys to `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html`  \n✅ HTTPS with self-signed certificate  \n✅ Post-receive hook triggers deployment on push  \n✅ Deployment completes in ~400ms (< 3 second requirement)  \n\nThe system is fully operational and ready for testing with real repository operations.","ttft_ms":4364,"type":"result","duration_ms":247301,"uuid":"a9895b1f-b436-4715-805d-d1c76bcfd441","ttft_stream_ms":905,"time_to_request_ms":88,"queued_turn_count":0}
